Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libpff

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libpff/archive/refs/tags/20261030.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libpff-20261030-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libpff-20261030-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libpff-20261030-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libpff-20261030-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libpff1-20261030-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libpff-devel-20261030-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libpff-20261030-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libpff)
  /usr/bin/pffexport.exe
  /usr/bin/pffinfo.exe
